# 🔐 Auth API - Login & Protect

A secure REST API built using **Node.js**, **Express.js**, and **Supabase Authentication**. This project demonstrates user authentication with JWTs, route protection using middleware, and interactive API documentation with Swagger UI.

> **FlyRank Backend AI Engineering Internship**  
> **Week 4 Assignment – Auth: Login & Protect**

---

# 🚀 Features

- User Registration (Sign Up)
- User Login
- User Logout
- JWT Authentication using Supabase Auth
- Protected Routes
- Authentication Middleware
- Public API Endpoint
- Swagger UI Documentation
- Environment Variables for Secure Configuration

---

# 🛠 Tech Stack

- Node.js
- Express.js
- Supabase Authentication
- JWT (JSON Web Token)
- Swagger UI Express
- dotenv
- cors

---

# 📂 Project Structure

```
auth-api/
│
